---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Made in China Peptide" description="Who we are: a documentation-first B2B sourcing channel for research peptides manufactured in China, serving laboratories, distributors and OEM brands." canonical="/about/">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › About</p>
    <h1>About {site.brand}</h1>
    <p class="lead muted">We are a B2B sourcing channel — not a marketplace and not a retail store. We work with a limited number of manufacturing partners in China and sell only to qualified research and trade buyers.</p>

    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>We coordinate product sourcing, batch documentation, packaging and export logistics for research peptides. Our value is not access to a catalogue — catalogues are everywhere — but the ability to answer three questions with evidence: what is in the vial, how was it tested, and can the batch be traced.</p>

    <h2>What we do not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not sell to consumers or for personal use.</li>
      <li>We do not provide dosing, medical or therapeutic advice.</li>
      <li>We do not claim certifications we cannot document.</li>
      <li>We do not publish one COA and apply it to every shipment.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Qualification: we confirm the buyer is a laboratory, distributor or brand.</li>
      <li>Specification: product, strength, volume, destination and documentation needs.</li>
      <li>Evidence: batch COA and analytical data before commitment.</li>
      <li>Supply: production, QC release, export documentation, tracked shipping.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />WhatsApp: {site.whatsapp}</p>
    <p class="small muted">Company registration and factory details are provided to qualified buyers during onboarding.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
